%N A399177 The sequence P(n) defined by Alkan et al. (2020).
%C A399177 See Alkan et al. (2020) for the somewhat complicated definition.
%C A399177 Section 2.2 of Alkan et al. (2020) defines three sequences: W(k) (Definition 3), P(k) (Definition 4, the present sequence), and R(k) (Definition 5, A399178). The initial terms of W(k) are not shown, so this is also a potentially new OEIS entry.
%D A399177 Altug Alkan, Nathan Fox, Orhan Ozgur Aybara, and Zehra Akdeniz, An exploration of solutions to two related Hofstadter-Huber recurrence relations, Chaos, Solitons & Fractals, Volume 138, September 2020, #109900; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chaos.2020.109900. See Table 1.
